-- Accumulation order is observable. Over 1, 1e100, -1e100 the left recurrence answers 0 and a right fold answers 1, so this column tells the two apart where tidy small numbers cannot.
-- The last line of each pair is the law A13 exists to hold: the fold is the last element of its own scan. The mean is a prefix machine, and its finish accumulates in the machine's order for the same reason.
--! registry ../registries/139-accumulation-order.reg

--! out 0
+/ Drift

--! out 1 1e100 0
+\ Drift

--! out 0 0 1
(+\ Drift) == (+/ Drift)

--! out 0
avg/ Drift

--! out 1 5e99 0
avg\ Drift

--! out 0 0 1
(avg\ Drift) == (avg/ Drift)

--! out 1e100
max/ Drift

--! out -1e100
min/ Drift
